1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 23=

12
00:01:26,519 --> 00:01:27,239
Shiqi.

13
00:01:28,959 --> 00:01:29,599
Master.

14
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:31,760
Have you seen Chu Li these past days?

15
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:34,760
Miss Chu Li hasn't come by for days.

16
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,640
Where could she have gone?

17
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:39,799
Well,

18
00:01:39,979 --> 00:01:40,879
go look for her.

19
00:01:41,439 --> 00:01:42,079
Master,

20
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:44,040
isn't it better

21
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:45,239
that she's not coming to you now?

22
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:46,640
I said go find her.

23
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,680
Enough with the nonsense.

24
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,359
Just go.

25
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,120
Understood.

26
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,400
Xiuxiu?

27
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:14,439
Where are you taking me?

28
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:20,960
Chu Li!

29
00:02:21,219 --> 00:02:22,159
What happened, Chu Li?

30
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,120
Am I dreaming?

31
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:29,879
What happened?

32
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:35,719
There's a clay sculptor

33
00:02:35,939 --> 00:02:37,180
using dark arts to swap souls.

34
00:02:37,779 --> 00:02:38,819
I have to stop him.

35
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:41,479
Why didn't you tell me?

36
00:02:44,659 --> 00:02:45,980
Let's go. Come on.

37
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,080
My chest hurts so much.

38
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:00,960
Are you all right?

39
00:04:18,003 --> 00:04:24,550
♪I grind ink as the night deepens,
my brush hangs heavy as lead♪

40
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,480
Grand Shaman,

41
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,680
I want to marry Diviner Song.

42
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,079
You've left the Shaman Clan.

43
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,879
No need to tell me.

44
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,480
I'm not here
as a member of the Shaman Clan.

45
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:37,399
I'm here

46
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,879
as your daughter.

47
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,560
As you wish.

48
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,040
But you must leave the Shaman Clan,

49
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,279
and Jinan City, too.

50
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,560
(So)

51
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,839
(Mother had already
foreseen the disaster)

52
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,160
(that would befall Jinan City.)

53
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,720
(That's why she kept driving me away.)

54
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:04,022
♪My heart, a lonely fortress, locks
its gates around love's vines for you♪

55
00:05:04,290 --> 00:05:06,903
♪Ask not what kind of love this is♪

56
00:05:06,950 --> 00:05:10,157
♪It's heartbreak, obsession,
and madness♪

57
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:11,439
(I once thought)

58
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:14,439
(these were things
that would happen in the future.)

59
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:16,279
(It turns out)

60
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:19,040
(they were memories of my past.)

61
00:05:20,638 --> 00:05:23,725
(Chu State)

62
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:33,319
Everyone in the Shaman Clan is dead.

63
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:36,680
Only I remain.

64
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:38,720
Li,

65
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,879
leave Jinan City.

66
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:44,399
You still have a chance.

67
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,360
My mother

68
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,560
and my clansmen died
protecting Jinan City.

69
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,319
How could I run away?

70
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:56,079
I want them back.

71
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,319
Li,

72
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,480
what are you going to do?

73
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:05,000
The Shaman Clan's forbidden art,
the Chu Phoenix Call,

74
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,680
can reverse time

75
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:09,800
and make everything start over.

76
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:13,399
If you summon the Chu Phoenix Call,

77
00:06:14,179 --> 00:06:15,020
what will happen to you?

78
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,600
I can make time in Jinan City

79
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,720
cycle ten times.

80
00:06:20,620 --> 00:06:22,140
Each cycle lasts only 49 days.

81
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:25,120
As long as everyone leaves Jinan City,

82
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,240
they won't be trapped
in the cycle again.

83
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,120
Ziyuan,

84
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,160
I'm sorry.

85
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,160
I'll use your three souls
and seven spirits as the price

86
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,879
to preserve your memories
through these ten lifetimes.

87
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,439
After ten times,

88
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,600
there will be no more chances.

89
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:42,099
You must take everyone,

90
00:06:43,099 --> 00:06:43,979
including me,

91
00:06:44,079 --> 00:06:45,399
♪Obsession meets spring once more♪

92
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,560
out of Jinan City.

93
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,480
No.

94
00:06:47,794 --> 00:06:49,575
♪You are like the bright moon
at the edge of the sky♪

95
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,399
Li...

96
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:52,360
♪Your light spills everywhere,
yet I cannot cup it in my hands♪

97
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,160
Don't do this.

98
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:56,560
If sacrificing only me

99
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,480
♪Heaven decrees our love runs deep,
yet we're not meant to be♪

100
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,959
can save everyone,

101
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:02,195
♪I trap myself inside a cocoon♪

102
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:03,959
then it's a gift from heaven.

103
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:05,439
♪Clinging to a hopeless, silent longing♪

104
00:07:05,439 --> 00:07:06,560
Don't do this, Li!

105
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:09,646
♪Your name echoes in the morning
and evening bells♪

106
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,560
Li!

107
00:07:11,174 --> 00:07:14,561
♪Ask not what my heart feels♪

108
00:07:18,869 --> 00:07:22,643
♪My heart is a lonely fortress,
locking love's vines inside♪

109
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:23,759
Li!

110
00:07:23,789 --> 00:07:25,589
♪Locking away a lifetime♪

111
00:07:26,082 --> 00:07:30,849
♪Ask not whether love
is madness or bone-deep pain♪

112
00:07:30,938 --> 00:07:36,554
♪Your smile reflected in another's cup♪

113
00:07:38,659 --> 00:07:42,585
♪Another's cup♪

114
00:07:46,256 --> 00:07:50,297
♪Half a farewell song, sung to the wind♪

115
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,800
Li!

116
00:08:00,616 --> 00:08:04,836
(Chu State)

117
00:08:14,539 --> 00:08:16,279
You actually brought her back?

118
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,279
Master,

119
00:08:18,439 --> 00:08:19,600
didn't you tell me to bring her back

120
00:08:19,639 --> 00:08:20,959
no matter what?

121
00:08:21,199 --> 00:08:22,199
She knows shamanic arts.

122
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,079
I was afraid I couldn't beat her.

123
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:25,240
Go, now.

124
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,120
Understood.

125
00:08:30,179 --> 00:08:31,000
Li.

126
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:38,519
Who are you? Why did you tie me up?

127
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,399
Are you insane?

128
00:08:46,620 --> 00:08:47,399
Li,

129
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,559
it's me.

130
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,080
This may sound absurd to you,

131
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,200
but you must believe
that everything I say is true.

132
00:08:56,620 --> 00:08:58,440
We were husband and wife
in our previous life.

133
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,000
We've been caught in a time loop.

134
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:03,000
More precisely,

135
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,639
everyone in Jinan City

136
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:06,759
has been caught in it.

137
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:13,879
Li,

138
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,240
everything I'm telling you is true.

139
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,679
We've been given another life

140
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:21,919
to save Jinan City from disaster.

141
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:24,879
Why do I get the feeling

142
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:27,480
you're up to no good?

143
00:09:28,020 --> 00:09:29,120
Of course not.

144
00:09:31,020 --> 00:09:32,600
You and I were husband and wife.

145
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:34,879
I know you don't believe me now,

146
00:09:35,459 --> 00:09:36,799
but I can prove it.

147
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:38,860
How will you prove it?

148
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:47,980
I know

149
00:09:49,340 --> 00:09:50,220
you can't read.

150
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,879
So what?

151
00:09:57,159 --> 00:09:59,200
I know even more of your secrets.

152
00:10:01,539 --> 00:10:02,380
Are you brave enough to hear them?

153
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:10,020
How could I possibly like you?

154
00:10:11,179 --> 00:10:12,860
A frail scholar like you...

155
00:10:13,299 --> 00:10:15,299
How could I like a man like you?

156
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:29,260
Still think I'm frail?

157
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:36,097
(Chu State)

158
00:10:46,419 --> 00:10:47,299
Why?

159
00:10:48,539 --> 00:10:50,539
Why, even in another life,

160
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:52,539
can't we change the ending?

161
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:54,620
It's all right.

162
00:10:55,140 --> 00:10:56,539
We still have eight more chances.

163
00:10:57,100 --> 00:10:58,699
If we fail again in the next life,

164
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,539
you must leave before the city falls.

165
00:11:01,900 --> 00:11:02,980
I can't leave.

166
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:09,059
As long as the 300,000 people
of Jinan City stay,

167
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:11,140
I stay.

168
00:11:23,726 --> 00:11:24,779
(Third Life)

169
00:11:24,779 --> 00:11:25,500
(Your Majesty,)

170
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:27,819
(the Qin Army will breach the city
any day.)

171
00:11:28,059 --> 00:11:29,179
(I beg Your Majesty to move the capital)

172
00:11:29,579 --> 00:11:30,659
(to save Jinan City)

173
00:11:30,779 --> 00:11:31,900
(and its 300,000 people.)

174
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:32,939
(Song Ziyuan,)

175
00:11:33,260 --> 00:11:34,459
(you're spreading lies
to mislead the people.)

176
00:11:34,779 --> 00:11:35,900
(Strip him of his office)

177
00:11:36,179 --> 00:11:37,459
(and execute him at once.)

178
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:39,419
(Fifth Life)
Everyone, run!

179
00:11:40,340 --> 00:11:42,340
Hurry and leave Jinan City!

180
00:11:43,179 --> 00:11:45,380
The Qin Army is about to slaughter
everyone in the city!

181
00:11:46,020 --> 00:11:47,579
Run, now!

182
00:11:49,220 --> 00:11:50,779
Run!

183
00:11:51,419 --> 00:11:52,380
(Fifth Life)

184
00:11:52,620 --> 00:11:54,059
(I tried every possible way)

185
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:55,500
(to persuade the people to leave.)

186
00:11:55,699 --> 00:11:56,980
(Still, I failed.)

187
00:12:02,290 --> 00:12:06,896
(Sixth Life)

188
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:13,340
Li?

189
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:15,819
Li!

190
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:18,980
It's already the sixth life.

191
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:22,299
I still failed.

192
00:12:25,020 --> 00:12:25,860
Ziyuan,

193
00:12:26,779 --> 00:12:27,699
don't cry.

194
00:12:28,939 --> 00:12:30,860
We still have four more chances.

195
00:12:32,539 --> 00:12:34,179
We'll meet again.

196
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:38,380
Li?

197
00:12:42,260 --> 00:12:44,419
Li!

198
00:12:50,860 --> 00:12:51,699
(Eighth Life)
Grand Shaman,

199
00:12:53,539 --> 00:12:54,779
it's already the eighth life.

200
00:12:56,179 --> 00:12:58,179
If I still can't save everyone,

201
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:00,579
then the Chu Phoenix Call...

202
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:03,500
The Chu Phoenix Call requires Li's body

203
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:05,459
and soul as payment.

204
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:08,179
Li was born

205
00:13:08,179 --> 00:13:10,779
to save Jinan City.

206
00:13:11,459 --> 00:13:12,299
Why?

207
00:13:13,539 --> 00:13:14,819
Why must Li

208
00:13:14,819 --> 00:13:16,220
bear such a fate?

209
00:13:17,140 --> 00:13:19,980
Li has already sacrificed her body
to the Phoenix.

210
00:13:20,699 --> 00:13:22,179
Remember, never let her

211
00:13:22,179 --> 00:13:23,699
summon the Chu Phoenix Call again.

212
00:13:23,939 --> 00:13:24,900
Otherwise,

213
00:13:25,539 --> 00:13:28,100
Li's soul will also be sacrificed
to the Phoenix,

214
00:13:28,779 --> 00:13:30,699
and she may never enter the cycle again.

215
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:35,860
Grand Shaman...

216
00:13:38,340 --> 00:13:40,459
If I still can't save everyone,

217
00:13:41,340 --> 00:13:43,459
I'm willing to share Jinan City's fate.

218
00:13:44,939 --> 00:13:45,699
But...

219
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:48,659
I want Li to live.

220
00:13:53,819 --> 00:13:54,860
In the next life,

221
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:57,980
I'll pretend I don't know her.

222
00:13:59,659 --> 00:14:01,620
I'll keep her far from Jinan City,

223
00:14:02,419 --> 00:14:03,779
far from all of this.

224
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,220
(I'm sorry.)

225
00:14:11,299 --> 00:14:12,380
(Ninth Life)

226
00:14:13,459 --> 00:14:15,179
(I deliberately pretended
not to know Li)

227
00:14:15,659 --> 00:14:17,179
(to keep her away from Jinan City.)

228
00:14:18,900 --> 00:14:20,779
(But I never expected
that after she heard the news,)

229
00:14:21,380 --> 00:14:22,620
(she came back anyway.)

230
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:27,459
(To stop Li from
summoning the Chu Phoenix Call again,)

231
00:14:29,059 --> 00:14:30,860
(I had no choice
but to kill her with my own hands.)

232
00:14:32,175 --> 00:14:38,620
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

233
00:14:38,675 --> 00:14:42,105
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

234
00:14:42,365 --> 00:14:45,585
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

235
00:14:45,625 --> 00:14:52,505
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

236
00:14:52,855 --> 00:14:56,385
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

237
00:14:56,545 --> 00:15:00,105
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

238
00:15:00,505 --> 00:15:06,945
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

239
00:15:06,990 --> 00:15:10,420
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

240
